Military Commander
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

How To Install
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
-UnLHA the file MCxxx.LHA to your PFILES: directory.
 (In Shell, in proper dir type: LHA x <filename> TO pfiles: )

-This should create a directory called Military in your PFILES directory.

-Go inside this and create a directory called USERS.
 (In shell, in pfiles:Military, type: makedir users )

-Go into CNet, and add a new Item, PICK AREXX for the game.
-Set up the path, and everything else by using PFILES:MILITARY/MILITARY.REXX

-If you want to customize Military Commander, see below for instructions.


THATS IT!

Enjoy!


