Configuring Military Commander to Your Own Liking:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

You can change some of the setup for MC by editing the game.data file in
the Military/Text drawer. Inside shows the format for what each variable
means. Do not exclude anything from this file, and be sure to keep it in
the same format. Be SURE that all of the values are on the FIRST line
seperated by COMMAS. If you have any questions, email me.


